@startuml Hinh_2_8_Sequence_UC_SYS_01_Chuyen_doi_Video_HLS_RabbitMQ
title Hình 2.8: Biểu đồ tuần tự Tải lên & Chuyển đổi Video HLS qua RabbitMQ (UC-SYS-01)
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

actor "Giảng viên" as Teacher
participant "VideoController" as VideoCtrl
participant "MySQL DB\n(videos)" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ\n(queue)" as RabbitMQ
participant "VideoConsumer" as Consumer
participant "FFmpeg" as FFmpeg
participant "Cloudflare R2" as R2
actor "Admin" as Admin

Teacher -> VideoCtrl: POST /api/v1/videos/upload\n(Tệp video MP4)
VideoCtrl -> VideoCtrl: Lưu tạm MP4 vào uploads/videos
VideoCtrl -> DB: INSERT videos (status: DRAFT)
VideoCtrl -> RabbitMQ: push(VideoTranscodeMessage)
VideoCtrl --> Teacher: HTTP 202 Accepted {videoId}

RabbitMQ -> Consumer: @RabbitListener nhận message
Consumer -> DB: UPDATE videos SET status = PROCESSING
Consumer -> FFmpeg: Chạy lệnh FFmpeg HLS (-hls_time 6)
FFmpeg -> FFmpeg: Sinh master.m3u8 và các phân đoạn .ts
FFmpeg --> Consumer: Phân đoạn hoàn tất (Exit code 0)

Consumer -> R2: uploadHlsFolder("hls/{videoId}")
Consumer -> R2: uploadFile("raw/{videoId}/video.mp4")
Consumer -> Consumer: Xóa file tạm nội bộ giải phóng ổ cứng
Consumer -> DB: UPDATE status = PENDING_REVIEW\n(Lưu hls_playlist_url & raw_storage_url)
Consumer -> Admin: notifyAdmin("Video mới chờ phê duyệt")

Admin -> VideoCtrl: POST /api/v1/videos/{id}/approve
VideoCtrl -> DB: UPDATE videos SET status = APPROVED
VideoCtrl --> Admin: HTTP 200 OK (Sẵn sàng phát luồng HLS)
@enduml